        "description": "Requires platform.admin.session.revoke held through an active Platform Owner or Security and Audit role, TOTP-backed AAL2 no older than 15 minutes, exact target versions and UUID idempotency. The actor cannot target themselves and must use the separate account-owner logout/revoke-all journey. Success atomically advances the target auth_epoch and platform context generation, revokes current sessions and records minimal evidence without device, IP or location metadata; it does not disable the identity or alter roles.",
